Package: woc-widget-cosmic-applet
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Fernando Ramirez
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: io-github-fernandox7-wocplayercount (= @VERSION@)
Description: Native COSMIC panel applet for WoC Player Count
 Displays the configured live WoC label in the COSMIC panel and opens or
 focuses the main WoC Player Count application when pressed.
